The protocol table's request answered on a prompt-turn cancel: when the client
sends session/cancel, its pending session/request_permission for that session
is answered with the outcome's cancelled variant at once, whatever its handler
does (0017-MADR-remediate-acp-v1-conformance-violations.md, Q1).

